  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sk Ibrahim vs State Of Andhara Pradesh on 5 August, 2020 Author: Ninala Jayasurya Bench: Ninala Jayasurya The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Ninala Jayasurya Criminal Petition No.3021 Of 2020 Order: (Heard and pronounced through Blue Jeans App (virtual) mode, since this mode is adopted on account of prevalence of Covid-19 Pandemic) Heard the learned counsel for the petitioners and",
    "facts": "2. The Criminal Petition is filed under Section 482 of Cr.P.C, seeking to quash the proceedings in FIR No.180 of 2020, dated 28.07.2020 on the file of Bitragunta Police Station, SPSR Nellore District. 2. The petitioner is A.1 in Crime No.180 of 2020. The said crime has been registered against the petitioner for the alleged offences punishable under Sections 272, 273, 328 of IPC and Section 59(1) of the Food, Safety and Standards Act, 2006 (for short 'the FSS Act).",
